{"body": "Changes\n\nliveEntries() and iterator() are now sharing underlying code\nColumn stats are always projected when querying either allEntries() or liveEntries() or iterator()\n1. ManifestGroup now relies on a builder\nallEntries(), liveEntries() and iterator()  does not reuse containers and creates a copy. If this is too expensive in some case we can have a option  to reuseContainers\n\nThese changes will affect #315 as well\nUpdate\n\nColumn stats now projected in allEntries() or liveEntries() or iterator() if required for metrics evaluation\nReverted to old behavior of allEntries(), liveEntries()  do not create copies of entries whereas iterator() does", "date": "2020-01-13T18:54:40Z", "hash": "sha256:38c083341329a12404bd", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#735", "meta": {"additions": 117, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2020-01-27T18:32:15Z", "comments": 17, "deletions": 124, "draft": false, "files": ["core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/FilteredManifest.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/FindFiles.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/ManifestGroup.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/ManifestReader.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/ScanSummary.java", "core/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/TestFindFiles.java"], "merged_at": "2020-01-27T18:32:15Z", "merged_by": "rdblue", "n_files": 6, "number": 735, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "reviews": [{"at": "2020-01-17T22:13:46Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2020-01-17T22:15:44Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2020-01-17T22:17:04Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2020-01-19T04:02:02Z", "by": "rdsr", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2020-01-23T18:46:11Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2020-01-23T18:49:00Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2020-01-23T18:53:25Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2020-01-23T18:54:43Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2020-01-23T19:16:44Z", "by": "rd